TEXT -96 864 Left 2 ;Four coupled oscillators A-D: shared SYNC net (g) and supply, digipot couplers between opposite terminals.
TEXT -96 904 Left 2 ;XA-XD: subcircuit osc (osc.lib), one oscillator each with a 10x probe on _L. Ct fits each one's free-running frequency on the bench (A 1.0521, B 1.0333, C 1.0082, D 1.0081 MHz; 10x probes, no couplers).
TEXT -96 936 Left 2 ;Couplers: MCP4351 W-B rheostats, Rc(code) = Rwiper + code/256 Rpot; code < 0 is disconnected. Wiring (coupling-network.tex): j - i odd joins i_L to j_R, even joins i_R to j_L, so every coupler is antiferromagnetic.
TEXT -96 976 Left 2 ;Default graph: ring4b (AB, BC, CD, DA at code 0). Plot the phases with: python ../io/ltspice.py device4.raw --phase a b c d
TEXT -96 1008 Left 2 ;g and supply: shared by all four, as in oscillator.asc (the board's other four oscillators E-H are not modelled).
TEXT -96 1056 Left 2 !.include osc.lib
TEXT -96 1096 Left 2 !.func Rc(code) {if(code<0,1T,Rwiper+code/256*Rpot)}
TEXT -96 1128 Left 2 !.param codeAB=-1 codeBC=-1 codeCD=0 codeAD=-1 codeAC=-1 codeBD=0 Rwiper=75 Rpot=10k
TEXT -96 1168 Left 2 !.param CtA=705p CtB=732p CtC=773p CtD=774p
TEXT -96 1200 Left 2 !.param Lt=29.95u Q=40 Rs=1k Rout=60 Vcc=3.3 gain=30 td=40n Ton=5u Rloss=4k
TEXT -96 1240 Left 2 !.param Chc=3p Cwin=2p Cpot=10p Cprobe=12p Csync=100p Rj8=1G Rsup=0.1 Lsup=100n
TEXT -96 1272 Left 2 !.tran 0 300u 0 2n
TEXT -96 1312 Left 2 !.save V(a_l) V(a_r) V(b_l) V(b_r) V(c_l) V(c_r) V(d_l) V(d_r) V(g) V(vcc)
TEXT -96 1344 Left 2 !.meas tran gpp pp V(g) from 250u to 300u
